**Read:** [Steels: Structure, Properties, and Design — Bhadeshia and Honeycombe](../sources/Steels-Structure-Properties-and-Design.lingua#r_5CB9R75MR8424M7VJ5Y33FY0QF), the whole weld/additive microstructure and modeling chapters, when available; [Materials Processing — Chris Schuh, MIT 3.044](../sources/Materials-Processing-MIT-3-044.lingua#r_4V5BA7W1TFKGRTGNHN7ZTAK1TW), complete relevant heat/flow, solidification, and scaling methods; [Powder Metallurgy — Ranjit Bauri, NPTEL](../sources/Powder-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_06YWQNWNS5SXW55R7J60Y70RND), all relevant feed/structure/consolidation discussions; [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), complete applicable weld, phase/thermal-history, and structure-property material.

Metal additive routes join feed delivery, energy or binder/intermediate processing, local consolidation/solidification, atmosphere, geometry, and repeated thermal cycles. Powder- and wire-based feeds have different preparation and quality questions. A process name or nominal energy-density number does not fully determine the local history or final material.

Reuse heat/flow, interfaces, segregation, phase transformations, deformation/stress, and powder/surface knowledge. Melt-pool or consolidation behavior, lack of bonding/fusion, pores, cracks, inclusions, texture, spatial chemistry, and residual stress can produce competing explanations for measured properties. Build orientation, geometry, support, and subsequent treatment matter.

Compare as-produced and post-treated states with independent structural, chemical, mechanical, and nondestructive evidence at representative supports. One impressive coupon is distinguished from stable repeatability across positions, batches, geometries, and feed reuse histories. Trace process observations and material identity to final tests.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete primary metal-additive study and its full methods, raw-observation definitions, model, and property evidence. Independently check a significant thermal/material calculation and its numerical limits. Compare two plausible defect/structure mechanisms using complementary observations and a separate condition. Defend an alternative process/post-treatment route for a specified function, including inspection, maintainability, feed, utilities, and uncertainty rather than only successful geometry.

**Continue:** [Interpret compositional maps with calibration and geological domain identity](../../../../gaia/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/analysis/Compositional-maps-domains-and-image-analysis.lingua#r_5393SVPBBX49ZR6Z1P58HX1GEP).

